# The futa05 preview build output (same rule as web/dist/): generated, never committed.
web/dist-preview/
# The same build, written to a second directory so a running preview cannot collide with it. The
# suites pass `--outDir dist-futa05` for exactly that reason, so it must be ignored like its sibling
# rather than showing up as an untracked change on every test run.
web/dist-futa05/
